{"detail": {"templateUuid": "e7e94d566b974750a9f958c6fefaecc3", "projectUuid": "93b89b112e674ef4b1e83a84d393cd45", "name": "《周处·朝闻道》", "description": "西晋阳羡，将门之后周处因行事张扬被乡人指为“废物”“不如其父”。他撕下杀虎告示孤身上山，却连野猪都打不过，幸得老猎户张猎户所救。张猎户教他：“把命钉在这山里。”周处日夜苦练，终从莽撞少年蜕变为真正猎人。然而当南山虎现身时，张猎户为救他而死，临终指路王铁匠的杀虎刀。周处取刀，披上父亲旧战袍，搏命斩杀猛虎。他拖着虎头回城，以为能换来尊敬，百姓却远远躲开，窃窃私语：“他比虎还可怕。”不久，龙王祭祀大典上，大祭司以“龙王降罪”为由要将一名小女孩献祭。周处看穿水中“龙王”不过是披鳞甲的扬子鳄，挥刀斩破祭坛，救下女孩。百姓却跪地骂他“惹怒龙王”“破坏风水”。虎是他杀的，“龙”是他斩的，世人却说他是第三害。周处闭眼，睁眼时眼中烈火燎原：“世人判我为三害之首——我便亲手斩尽三害，重写我的命数！”", "coverUrl": "/assets/14195f1b81f9374e.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/33799f85c21e4dfbb92456b50d54f45c/1e8c63c1de91ba7e28d73e60613a37bfff663cfe.mp4", "snapshotId": 23146, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 9058690, "ownerUuid": "33799f85c21e4dfbb92456b50d54f45c", "avatar": "/assets/50f942cbb80b3dda.webp", "nickname": "Toast", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 14, "tags": [{"id": 3036, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "AI漫剧精卫计划", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3036/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 3038, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "2-国风非遗专项", "parentTag": 3036, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3036/3038", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 1803, "code": "virtual_human", "tagLabel": "仿真人", "parentTag": 1800, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1800/1803/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 3, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "score": 0, "socialMediaUrl": "https://v.douyin.com/tz5822gY9e8/", "createAt": "2026年06月30日 17:55", "updateAt": "2026年07月02日 23:25", "publishAt": "2026年06月30日 17:55", "playCount": 13, "viewCreationProcessCount": 4, "copyCanvasCount": 0, "shareCount": 0, "snapshotPath": "/data/canvas-snapshots/e7e94d566b974750a9f958c6fefaecc3.json.gz", "snapshotSummary": {"nodes": 507, "edges": 980}}, "recommendList": []}